  "instructions": [
    "In medium bowl , mix together egg white , soy sauce , salt , sugar , pepper , cinnamon , and cloves",
    "Stir chicken pieces into mixture",
    "Marinate , covered , in the refrigerator for 20 minutes",
    "Mix together the flour , chicken broth , cornstarch , 1 teaspoon salt , the baking soda , almonds and almond extract",
    "Stir chicken into batter until well coated",
    "In wok , heat 1 1 / 2-inches oil to 350f",
    "Fry chicken pieces , about fifteen at a time , turning frequently , until light brown",
    "Drain on paper towels",
    "Increase oil temperature to 375f",
    "Fry chicken all at once until golden brown",
    "Drain on paper towels",
    "Serve with dipping sauce"
